  "liner": {
   "body_md": "This audience recording captures the Mountain Goats performing at the Showbox in Seattle, Washington, on June 10, 2014 [1]. The setlist includes twenty-two songs, spanning from early tracks like “High Hawk Season” to later material such as “This Year” [1][2]. The recording features “Twin Human Highway” and “Isaiah,” both of which are the only archived performances of these songs [1][2]. It also includes “Short Song about the 10 Freeway,” a rare track with only five archived performances, and “Black Molly,” which had not been played in 51 prior archived shows [1][2]. The audio was captured by tungol using an iPhone 5s running iTalk Recorder, with the device stored in a zipped pocket of a bag while standing in the middle of the crowd [1]. The recording started at 22:04:26 and ended at 23:40:32 on June 10, 2014, resulting in a 94-minute file [1]. The taper noted the file was recorded at 11.025 kHz [1]. This is the only available recording of this specific show, which is the 195th of 467 archived performances for the band [1][2]. The previous archived show was in Chicago on April 20, 2014 [2]. The file was transferred by roffels [1].",
